items.description:
@home is a homeware and decor retailer trading from Constantia Village, stocking furniture, soft furnishings and household accessories for the home. The centre's own directory of stores places @home among its Main Village retailers, trading alongside anchors such as Pick n Pay and Woolworths Food rather than as a standalone unit tucked away from the centre's main flow of shoppers.

That central position within the Main Village section means @home benefits from the same foot traffic as the centre's larger grocery anchors, making it an easy addition to a regular shopping trip rather than a destination visit on its own.

Trading from Constantia Village on Constantia Road, Constantia, the store suits homeowners, decorators and shoppers looking to add furniture, soft furnishings or home accessories to their shopping round.
